  'Application for Vehicle Registration (Ministry of Transportation). Section 1 is the vehicle''s registrant: the owner''s corporation under a Lease, the owner under Co-Registrant, the lessor (leased car) or CarmaCars (owned car) under a Transfer; "Number plates owned by other than above" is ticked when CarmaCars holds the plates as lessee, and "Vehicle to be registered to 2 individuals" under Co-Registrant. Section 7 carries the VIN. Section 8 is signed by the registrant''s signer: the owner (or their corporation''s signing officer) signs on screen under a Lease or Co-Registrant; CarmaCars'' signing officer signs under a Transfer. Left blank on purpose: sex (the registry asks it of new individual plate registrants only), the new plates question (the plate on record is attached), section 7''s insurer and policy (the fleet policy is written at the counter) and the office-use page. The lessor''s RIN and address under a Transfer of a leased car are on the lease and written at the counter. Mapping checked against the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/3c75269a-0400-4861-baf2-93a5d668f57c/resource/339a68c4-afe9-4cc8-a372-7c1665e27d14/download/sr-lv-006e.pdf, SHA-256 df4831f0bdcfc794a901f6dff79423e6982980276a3dc659edeed68162c9cc49); check it with a preview before use.');
