  'Proof of Business Address, obtaining or amending a Registrant Identification Number (RIN): the owner''s corporation needs a RIN to be the vehicle''s registrant under a Lease. The publisher''s PDF is an Adobe dynamic form with no fillable fields, so it was laid out as a plain PDF and each value is printed in the box of its field. The corporation''s address on record is the owner''s, so "operated out of the owner''s place of residence" is ticked Yes. Left blank on purpose: the other purposes (name or address change, merge, amalgamation), whether the vehicles are kept at this address (the owner answers), the post office box, the province (the laid-out form prints Ontario) and the office-use block. Mapping checked against the official PDF (https://forms.mgcs.gov.on.ca/dataset/013f8aa4-4c48-4845-973b-6ce3489dcf6a/resource/8939f879-0692-45a3-b29f-e3d57adea913/download/on00453e.pdf, SHA-256 a60e0c5d7bbb3a73b494c1767b9233e1f49e3b32bc27ff1eee1316c777d871f6); check it with a preview before use.');
